The generated memo is 355 words, the event-study PNG is 2240×1440 with embedded 320-dpi resolution, and visual inspection confirms the treatment boundary and simultaneous intervals render correctly. One independent numerical check agrees on all point estimates and Bacon shares; it also confirms that the pretrend result should be phrased as “not rejected,” not as proof.
