I found one clarity issue—not a numerical error—in the initial script: `mpdta$treat` is the ever-treated indicator, while the regression variable I created was already the cohort-specific treatment-on indicator. I’m using the single allowed revision cycle to express the TWFE regressor explicitly as `post × ever_treated`; the values and estimates are unchanged.
