codex
Completed all requested deliverables.

Key result: the preferred Callaway–Sant’Anna ATT is −0.0398 log points (SE 0.0123), roughly a 3.9% decline. TWFE is similar at −0.0365. Only 5.39% of Bacon weight comes from problematic later-vs-earlier comparisons, versus 86.28% from treated-vs-never comparisons. Pre-trends are not rejected (p = 0.168), though the short panel limits power.

